  "body": "**Blocked by:** none\n\n## Context\n\nPR #382's `purgeExpiredTrash.test.ts` flagged that its `ageDeletion` test helper\n(lines 33-38) runs `UPDATE items SET deleted_at = ... WHERE id = $1` with no\n`database_id` predicate. `items` is `PARTITION BY LIST (database_id)`, and the\nprimary key is `(database_id, id)`; without `database_id` in the `WHERE` clause,\nPostgres cannot prune to a single partition and instead scans every partition to\nfind the matching `id`, even though the query still returns the correct row.\n\n## Task\n\nIn `backend/packages/data/src/trash/__tests__/purgeExpiredTrash.test.ts`'s\n`ageDeletion` helper, add a `databaseId` parameter and include\n`AND database_id = $3` in the `UPDATE`'s `WHERE` clause, updating every call site in\nthis file to pass the item's `databaseId`.\n\n## Touches\n\n- backend/packages/data/src/trash/__tests__/purgeExpiredTrash.test.ts (`ageDeletion`\n  and its call sites)\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Adding the `database_id` predicate to `ageDeletion`'s `UPDATE` and threading the\n  parameter through its call sites in this file.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- Any other test helper or production code.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- `ageDeletion`'s `UPDATE` statement includes `database_id` in its `WHERE` clause.\n- Every existing test in this file that calls `ageDeletion` still passes, now passing\n  the item's `databaseId`.\n\n\n<!-- crb-followup:v1 pr=382 key=2800fbf07b -->",
